ree to full-time students and Halas members.","source_url":"https://www.luc.edu/campusrec/facilities/halasrecreationcenter/","source_title":"Halas Recreation Center | Loyola University Chicago","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Class schedules, closures, and access policies can change; verify them with Campus Recreation first.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"loyola-beach-park","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Loyola Beach Park","title":"Take a daytime lakefront walk","subtitle":"Saturday midday · Loyola Beach Park","notes":"Use public park paths in daylight, bring water, and check Chicago Park District notices for beach conditions and seasonal rules.","short_summary":"Step off campus for a nearby Lake Michigan shoreline walk.","evidence_claim":"The Chicago Park District identifies Loyola Beach Park as a park facility in Chicago.","source_url":"https://www.chicagoparkdistrict.com/parks-facilities/loyola-beach-park","source_title":"Loyola Beach Park | Chicago Park District","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Follow all Chicago Park District rules, closures, and swimming advisories.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"loyola-university-museum-of-art","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Loyola University Museum of Art","title":"Visit LUMA downtown","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Water Tower Campus","notes":"Plan a daytime Red Line trip, then review the museum’s current exhibitions and visitor details before you enter Lewis Towers.","short_summary":"Connect Loyola’s downtown campus with an on-campus art museum visit.","evidence_claim":"LUMA states that it was founded on Loyola’s Water Tower Campus and is located at 820 North Michigan Avenue in Lewis Towers.